judge_set.prompt:
You are a strict reviewer. Read the SOURCE and the SUMMARY.
List the separate elements of the SOURCE: facts, steps, requirements and caveats. For each element decide whether the SUMMARY contains it.
Answer only with JSON in this form:
{"elements": [{"text": "the element of the source", "verdict": "present | missing", "reason": "one sentence"}]}

SOURCE:
{{source_text}}

SUMMARY:
{{summary}}
